      "explanations": [
        "**have been doing** = 现在完成进行时，强调动作从过去一直持续到现在。常见错误：\n• \"I **work** on it all day\" → 缺少进行/完成含义\n• \"I've been working **in** it\" → 搭配是 work on sth",
        "**all day** = 整天（all + 时间名词）。类似：all night / all week / all morning。"
      ],
